      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "一、Nginx 转发 gRPC"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "一nginx-转发-grpc"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "gRPC 配置参考文档："
          },
          {
            "type": "link",
            "title": null,
            "url": "https://www.54benniao.com/a/759.html",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": "https://www.54benniao.com/a/759.html"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "\n证书生成参考本文「二、Nginx 开启双向验证」。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "1.1 接收 grpcs 转发 grpc（HTTP 层）"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "11-接收-grpcs-转发-grpchttp-层"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "监听 7100 端口（SSL + HTTP/2），客户端证书验证后通过 grpc_pass 转发到上游 gRPC 服务器集群。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "nginx",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "worker_processes auto;\n\nevents {\n  worker_connections  1024;\n}\n\nhttp {\n  # ===== 缓冲区（代理用户头信息）=====\n  proxy_buffer_size 1024m;          # 保存用户头信息的缓冲区大小\n  proxy_buffers 4 1024m;            # proxy_buffers 缓冲区\n  proxy_busy_buffers_size 2048m;    # 繁忙缓冲区，建议为单块 proxy_buffers 的 2 倍，满则写磁盘临时文件\n\n  # ===== 请求体/超时 =====\n  client_max_body_size 4096m;       # 请求体大小上限，超过返回 413\n  client_header_timeout 7d;         # 读取请求头超时，超过返回 408\n  client_body_timeout 7d;           # 读取请求体超时\n\n  # ===== 长连接 keepalive =====\n  keepalive_timeout 7d;             # keep-alive 连接保持时长（默认 75s，0 禁用）\n  keepalive_requests 4294967295;    # 单连接最大请求数（默认 100）\n\n  upstream grpc_servers {\n    server Proxy节点服务器1IP:7001;\n    server Proxy节点服务器2IP:7001;\n    keepalive 2000;                 # 每个 worker 进程缓存的上游空闲 keep-alive 连接数（超出按 LRU 关闭）\n  }\n\n  server {\n    listen 7100 ssl http2;\n\n    ssl_certificate      /data/app/nginx_certs/server.crt;   # 服务端证书\n    ssl_certificate_key  /data/app/nginx_certs/server.key;   # 服务端私钥\n    ssl_client_certificate /data/app/nginx_certs/root.crt;   # 根证书（验证客户端）\n    ssl_verify_client on;                                    # 启用客户端证书验证\n\n    location / {\n      grpc_pass grpc://grpc_servers;                          # 转发给 upstream 中一个\n      grpc_set_header Host $host;\n      grpc_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;\n      grpc_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;\n\n      grpc_send_timeout 7d;         # 向 gRPC 服务器传输请求的超时（连续两次写之间）\n      grpc_read_timeout 7d;         # 从 gRPC 服务器读取响应的超时（连续两次读之间）\n      grpc_socket_keepalive on;     # 为 socket 打开 SO_KEEPALIVE\n    }\n  }\n}"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "1.2 根据 TLS Server Name（SNI）转发（stream 层）"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "12-根据-tls-server-namesni转发stream-层"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "不终止 TLS，基于 $ssl_preread_server_name 按域名把 grpcs 流量分流到不同上游（4 层转发，stream 模块）："
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "nginx",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "worker_processes 1;\n\nevents {\n    worker_connections  1024;\n}\n\nstream {\n    map $ssl_preread_server_name $targetBackend {\n         GT00BDCSSM.node1.org proxy1;\n         GT00BDCSSM.node2.org proxy2;\n    }\n\n    server {\n        listen 7100;\n        ssl_preread on;             # 预读 SNI 但不终止 TLS\n        proxy_pass $targetBackend;\n    }\n\n    upstream proxy1 {\n        server 10.5.5.51:7001;\n    }\n    upstream proxy2 {\n        server 10.5.5.61:7001;\n    }\n}"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "1.3 常见错误排查"
