      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "二、Nginx 开启双向验证（mTLS）"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "二nginx-开启双向验证mtls"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "双向验证（mTLS）：服务端不仅要出示自己的证书，还要验证客户端证书（ssl_verify_client on）。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "2.1 生成自签名根证书（可选）"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "21-生成自签名根证书可选"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "openssl genrsa -out root.key 2048\nopenssl req -x509 -new -nodes -key root.key -sha256 -days 3650 -out root.crt -subj \"/CN=chainamker.org\""
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "2.2 生成服务器私钥和证书"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "22-生成服务器私钥和证书"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "# 1. 生成服务器私钥 + CSR\nopenssl genrsa -out server.key 2048\nopenssl req -new -key server.key -out server.csr -subj \"/CN=server.org\"\n\n# 2. 使用自签名根证书签署服务器证书\nopenssl x509 -req -in server.csr -CA root.crt -CAkey root.key -CAcreateserial -out server.crt -days 3650 -sha256"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "2.3 生成客户端证书"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "23-生成客户端证书"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "# 1. 生成客户端私钥\nopenssl genrsa -out client.key 2048\n\n# 2. 生成客户端 CSR\nopenssl req -new -key client.key -out client.csr -subj \"/CN=client.org\"\n\n# 3a. 使用自签名根证书签署客户端证书\nopenssl x509 -req -in client.csr -CA root.crt -CAkey root.key -CAcreateserial -out client.crt -days 3650 -sha256\n\n# 3b. 或使用受信任的 CA 签署客户端证书\nopenssl x509 -req -in client.csr -CA ca.crt -CAkey ca.key -out client.crt -days 3650 -sha256"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "2.4 配置到 Nginx"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "24-配置到-nginx"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "nginx",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "server {\n    listen 443 ssl;\n    server_name example.com;\n\n    ssl_certificate      /path/to/server.crt;   # 服务器证书\n    ssl_certificate_key  /path/to/server.key;   # 服务器私钥\n    ssl_client_certificate /path/to/client.crt; # 客户端证书（验证客户端用）\n    ssl_verify_client on;                       # 开启客户端证书验证\n\n    # 其他 SSL 配置项（密码套件、协议等）\n}"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "注意：/path/to/ 替换为实际证书路径。若使用受信 CA 签发的证书，ssl_client_certificate 应指向 CA 证书。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
